  <wpt lat="55.61221587471664" lon="-2.220385177060962">
    <ele>69</ele>
    <time>2022-08-30T20:08:44Z</time>
    <name>THROUGH GATE - leaving it as you found it</name>
    <cmt>If you are heading west - do NOT follow the main track as it is PRIVATE. Pass though the wooden gate leaving the gate as you found it. Please ride slowly and carefully with the farmhouse on your left and the farm on your right to the farm driveway.

If heading East leave the farm driveway with the farmhouse on your right and the farm on your left. Take care on the grass and please ride slowly. Pass through the wooden gate, leaving it as you found it. Turn left along the gravel track watching out for other users.
</cmt>
    <desc>If you are heading west - do NOT follow the main track as it is PRIVATE. Pass though the wooden gate leaving the gate as you found it. Please ride slowly and carefully with the farmhouse on your left and the farm on your right to the farm driveway.

If heading East leave the farm driveway with the farmhouse on your right and the farm on your left. Take care on the grass and please ride slowly. Pass through the wooden gate, leaving it as you found it. Turn left along the gravel track watching out for other users.
</desc>
    <sym>Information</sym>
    <type>user</type>
